  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Wu Yong assigns Wu Yi Hai to handle a sudden Mount Snail matter after Fang Yuan asks about Mountain Moving Old Monster and Mount Snail.",
      "chapters": [
        1314
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong",
        "char_wu_yi_hai",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mount Snail is an immemorial desolate beast, an enormous river snail with a tall tower-like spiral shell drenched with green moss. When still, its body hides in the shell and looks like a towering mountain. Its temperament is simple and mild, hard to anger, and almost harmless, yet its body is full of enslavement path and earth path dao marks that spawn matching resources. Few Gu Immortals can control it, even rank eight enslavement path experts, because of those enslavement path dao marks. Southern Border has seven known Mount Snails; by old agreement a wild Mount Snail counts as a resource of the clan whose territory holds it. This Mount Snail lived in Wu clan territory after Wu Du Xiu expanded to include it, and it is migrating out toward land without other righteous path super forces, which would make it wild again.",
      "chapters": [
        1315
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mount-snail",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "char_wu_du_xiu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Gu Immortal flies over, names himself Qin Jin Sheng, and says he is also called Mountain Moving Old Monster. He wears rocky grey armor, has messy black and white hair like straw, looks slovenly with shredded clothes corners, and gives off a majestic rank seven aura with sharp eyes. He has lived over two thousand years, holds lifespan Gu and lifespan extension methods, and is a famous lone immortal expert near Old Treeman Ba De and Wu Yu Bo. He tries to bribe Fang Yuan with an information path mortal Gu listing resources that could build coiling thread caves in exchange for taking Mount Snail. Fang Yuan doubles the list, keeps Mount Snail belonging to Wu clan in name, and requires a yearly resource portion to Wu clan while Mountain Moving Old Monster takes most real benefits. After silence, Mountain Moving Old Monster agrees.",
      "chapters": [
        1315
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "meeting-and-deal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_lifespan_gu",
        "char_ba_de",
        "char_wu_yu_bo",
        "sys_information_path_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Days later Mount Snail moves away with Mountain Moving Old Monster standing on it with an owner’s air. As Wu clan representative, Fang Yuan has reached agreement: Mountain Moving Old Monster obtains most benefits, yet the immemorial desolate beast still belongs to Wu clan in name.",
      "chapters": [
        1316
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "settlement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
