      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan’s Wu Yi Hai identity is exposed, Wu Yong pressures him with force and persuasion until he becomes Wu clan’s external supreme elder. Wu Yong seats him on the left, calls him supreme elder Mountain Moving, and hands him charge of more than fifty Gu Masters’ immortal ascensions, many of them outsiders, both to avoid clan bias and to reassure the external elder.",
      "chapters": [
        2132
      ],
